        Attention2Probability: <span class="search-hit mathjax">Attention</span>-Driven Terminology Probability Estimation for Robust Speech-to-Text System
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Du%2C+Y">Yanfan Du</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+J">Jun Zhang</a>, 
      
