        Mechanistic Exploration of Backdoored Large Language Model <span class="search-hit mathjax">Attention</span> Patterns
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Baker%2C+M+A">Mohammed Abu Baker</a>, 
      
